{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Publish fatal MDC restoration failures to the caller.** The `finally` completes `result` with the pre-restoration outcome even when closing `restore` throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` on an asynchronous executor. The invocation can therefore return success or `PENDING` while its worker dies. Complete `result` exceptionally with the fatal before rethrowing it, and publish the selected outcome only after restoration succeeds.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Nu35","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":283,"observation_digest":"7cc164a10ed8ae0d1e21c45adf0dfca5594c241ea487873889de3b9e828b1f10","observation_id":"aro_v1_ptawjiio3cxa2hrbyrnn6dp4uv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T04:30:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gznuwbdoezgdubsa2zuhlunkko","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"880c672b694dd6e9859596872447c03fb779d522","reviewer":"codex","start_line":280,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_3qyr4cayl4pdukob4nu674zjyg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T04:30:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
